# No widget leak on page switches: the app opens and leaves every page (and its Choice and Typed pages) three times at
# start (NET_TOOLBOX_SELFTEST); the objects and timers of Home are counted before and after.
title Net Toolbox: page switches leak nothing
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1024x600 1280x720
env NET_TOOLBOX_DEMO diag=healthy,ping=mixed
env NET_TOOLBOX_FIXTURE deck
env NET_TOOLBOX_SELFTEST 1
shot home
expect text "leak check ok"
